      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……おい！
暗すぎだぞ、&lt;Shing&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...C'mon, quit lookin' so gloomy!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>や〜〜〜っと、元に戻った
&lt;Kohaku&gt;と会えるんだ。
もっと嬉しそうな顔しやがれ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You FINALLY get to see &lt;Kohaku&gt; back to her good old self. You should show her a smile!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……でも、オレ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>暗い顔しやがって……
・&lt;Kohaku&gt;の回復祝いしようぜ！
・元気出さねぇと、ぶん殴るぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What a sad sack...
・We should celebrate &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s recovery.
・If you don't pep up, I'll punch ya!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、そうだ！
&lt;Kohaku&gt;に会えたら
回復祝いしなきゃな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I got it! When we see &lt;Kohaku&gt; again, we should do somethin' to celebrate her recovery!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>食って歌って
大さわぎしようぜ！
な、楽しみだろ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We'll eat 'til we burst, sing and make a ruckus! It'll be fun! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うん。その時まで
世界が無事だといいけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah. I hope the world will still be in one piece before then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うっ…………
バ、バーカッ！
無事に決まってんだろ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh... you dingus! We'll MAKE sure it does...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>顔上げろ、&lt;Shing&gt;！
元気出さねぇと、ぶん殴るぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chin up, &lt;Shing&gt;! If you don't pep up, I'll punch ya!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……てめぇは命をかけて
&lt;Kohaku&gt;を元に戻したんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You put your life on the line to save her!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それは胸を張れる事だろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ain't that somethin' to be proud of?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それは胸を張れる事だろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ain't that somethin' to be proud of?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
